      "explanation": "Calculate the powers before dividing:\n\\[\n(0.2)^3=0.2\\times0.2\\times0.2=0.008,\n\\]\n\\[\n(0.02)^2=0.02\\times0.02=0.0004.\n\\]\nThe denominator is positive, so division is defined. Multiplying both numerator and denominator by \\(10000\\) makes the division simpler:\n\\[\n\\frac{0.008}{0.0004}=\\frac{80}{4}=20.\n\\]\nThe answer is \\(\\boxed{\\text{E}}\\).",
